+To configure minimum balances for your connected accounts, provide the currency codes and amounts in the *minor currency unit* (The Stripe API expects currency values using the given denomination's smallest unit represented without decimals. For example, enter 1099 to charge 10.99 USD (or any other two-decimal currency). Enter 10 to charge 10 JPY (or any other zero-decimal currency)).
+
+```curl
+curl https://api.stripe.com/v1/balance_settings \
+  -u "<<YOUR_SECRET_KEY>>:" \
+  -H "Stripe-Account: {{CONNECTEDACCOUNT_ID}}" \
+  -d "payments[payouts][minimum_balance_by_currency][usd]=1500" \
+  -d "payments[payouts][minimum_balance_by_currency][cad]=8000"
+```
